[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だぁぁぁぁっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "HAAAAAAH!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でやぁぁぁっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "HYAAAAH!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マクダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Magda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょっと！\u3000そんな暴れ方してたら、\nあんたたちのほうが先にバテちゃうわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey! Keep thrashing around like that and you'll wear yourselves out before the monsters do!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうよ。まだ魔物は残ってるんだから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Exactly. There are still plenty of monsters left."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリオン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marion"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わぁってるよ……くそっ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I know, I know... Damn it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それにしても、クリセルダは倒したのに、\nまだこんなに魔物たちが残ってるなんてね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's strange though. Even after we defeated Criselda, there are still so many monsters around."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "統率する長がいなくなっても、\n集められた魔物がいなくなるわけじゃないもの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, getting rid of their leader doesn't make the gathered monsters disappear."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリオン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marion"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これでも、騎士たちのおかげでかなり減らせたのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And thanks to the knights, we've already reduced their numbers significantly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリオン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marion"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さっさと残りも片付けちまおうぜ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's just hurry up and clean out the rest!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マクダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Magda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だから、焦っちゃダメって言ってるじゃない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I already told you not to be so hasty."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリオン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marion"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちっ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tch..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マクダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Magda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "理屈じゃ分かってる。ただ、ヴァレリアのために\n何もできねぇのが、もどかしいんだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I get it in my head, but... it's just frustrating that we can't do anything for Valeria."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "分かるぜ。あいつが目を覚まさねぇと、\n張り合いがねぇよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, I hear ya. Nothing feels right with her still out cold."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マクダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Magda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それでも、よ。今はレスナを信じて、\nできることをやるだけ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even so, all we can do now is trust in Resna and focus on what we can do."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリオン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marion"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "......"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マクダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Magda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大丈夫。レスナなら必ずやり遂げるわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't worry. If anyone can do it, Resna can."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それに、錬金術士のみんなも協力してくれてる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And all the other alchemists are helping too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリオン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marion"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "みんながヴァレリアを救おうとしてる。だから大丈夫よ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone's working together to save Valeria. She'll be fine."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリオン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marion"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]